{
 "duration": 56.26775,
 "frames": 1688,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Why is Super Glue so strong?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.011
  },
  {
   "text": "Because it was rejected...",
   "start": 2.518,
   "end": 3.74
  },
  {
   "text": "twice.",
   "start": 4.225,
   "end": 4.868
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen forty-two,",
   "start": 5.568,
   "end": 7.044
  },
  {
   "text": "during World War Two,",
   "start": 7.044,
   "end": 8.098
  },
  {
   "text": "a young chemist named Harry Coover was trying to make clear plastic gun sights for soldiers.",
   "start": 8.424,
   "end": 13.576
  },
  {
   "text": "He tested a chemical called cyanoacrylate.",
   "start": 14.143,
   "end": 16.685
  },
  {
   "text": "The problem?",
   "start": 17.191,
   "end": 17.721
  },
  {
   "text": "It stuck to everything.",
   "start": 18.284,
   "end": 19.711
  },
  {
   "text": "His tools.",
   "start": 20.049,
   "end": 20.87
  },
  {
   "text": "His glass.",
   "start": 20.87,
   "end": 21.69
  },
  {
   "text": "Probably his fingers.",
   "start": 21.966,
   "end": 23.179
  },
  {
   "text": "Too sticky.",
   "start": 23.74,
   "end": 24.481
  },
  {
   "text": "Rejected.",
   "start": 24.888,
   "end": 25.514
  },
  {
   "text": "Nine years later,",
   "start": 26.194,
   "end": 27.088
  },
  {
   "text": "his team tried it again,",
   "start": 27.273,
   "end": 28.55
  },
  {
   "text": "this time for jet airplane canopies.",
   "start": 28.842,
   "end": 30.994
  },
  {
   "text": "And again,",
   "start": 31.546,
   "end": 32.203
  },
  {
   "text": "it glued everything together.",
   "start": 32.391,
   "end": 34.17
  },
  {
   "text": "But this time,",
   "start": 34.808,
   "end": 35.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Coover stopped and thought: wait.",
   "start": 35.664,
   "end": 37.818
  },
  {
   "text": "Maybe sticky isn't the problem.",
   "start": 38.298,
   "end": 40.146
  },
  {
   "text": "Maybe sticky is the product.",
   "start": 40.683,
   "end": 42.528
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen fifty-eight,",
   "start": 43.083,
   "end": 44.204
  },
  {
   "text": "it hit store shelves.",
   "start": 44.405,
   "end": 45.637
  },
  {
   "text": "Just one drop could bond things in seconds.",
   "start": 46.001,
   "end": 48.847
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why Super Glue is so strong.",
   "start": 49.39,
   "end": 51.323
  },
  {
   "text": "It was a failure,",
   "start": 51.77,
   "end": 52.651
  },
  {
   "text": "until someone realized the failure was the point.",
   "start": 52.961,
   "end": 56.085
  }
 ]
}